OL,3,GNEWSA'Love where you live' aims to curb
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new free bulky waste collection
OL,7,Fservice is being started across
OL,8,FPeterborough to tackle the issue of
OL,9,Flittering and fly-tipping.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council has also
OL,12,Flaunched a new awareness campaign, Love
OL,13,FWhere You Live, in partnership with the
OL,14,FPeterborough Litter Wombles to
OL,15,Fhighlight the impact of fly-tipping.
OL,17,FThe council added that responsible
OL,18,Fwaste disposal could help reduce its
OL,19,Fcosts while creating cleaner and
OL,20,Fstronger communities.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
